    'const list = TL.marks || [];'), not behaviour: a handler that snapped to
    the farthest record would still pass it.

VERDICT: changes requested.
  Scenarios 5, 6 and 7 pass on the page rendered by the skill in this room, and
  the pixel-miss bug the card describes is gone (no "no record on this date" on
